Drop the +morse-mode LuCI dep from the openmanetargon theme.

The theme template (luasrc/view/themes/openmanetargon/header.htm) calls
util.ubus("morse-mode", "query") but nil-checks the result on every read,
so on a non-Morse build the morse-mode widgets just don't render. The
package-level dep on morse-mode is what makes the theme unbuildable here
(morse-mode transitively pulls in netifd-morse + morse-regdb, both
disabled in our diffconfig). Dropping the dep so it builds.

--- a/feeds/openmanet/luci/luci-theme-openmanetargon/Makefile
+++ b/feeds/openmanet/luci/luci-theme-openmanetargon/Makefile
@@ -1,7 +1,6 @@
 include $(TOPDIR)/rules.mk

 LUCI_TITLE:=LuCI OpenMANET Argon Theme
-LUCI_DEPENDS:=+morse-mode

 PKG_LICENSE:=Apache-2.0

